AI INTERPRETATION → SECURITY BASELINE MODEL → PROVENANCE → UNKNOWN
CONFIGURATION PIPELINE, per the Part 1 task brief. Parts 2/3 (compliance
decisioning, deployment/remediation) are explicitly out of scope and
untouched.

